  "_comment": "Two ideas averaged into one image. ConditioningAverage interpolates between the two encoded prompts rather than concatenating them, which is the difference between 'a lion and an eagle' (a picture containing both) and a genuine hybrid. conditioning_to_strength is the dial: 1.0 is entirely the first prompt, 0.0 entirely the second.",
